    "content": "<p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\"><strong>·11月更新内容前瞻</strong></span></span></p><p></p><p class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"b54ad628ccc3054475c8e59ace83dd18\" title=\"11月前瞻.png\" alt=\"11月前瞻.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/pic/20240822/b54ad628ccc3054475c8e59ace83dd18.png\"/></div><p></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\"><strong>·讲述者列表</strong></span></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"790a89c3b3110eb08a7e19a2e59847dc\" title=\"11月月小队.png\" alt=\"11月月小队.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/pic/20240822/790a89c3b3110eb08a7e19a2e59847dc.png\"/></div><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>奇遇讲述者截云</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">截云踏上了一条通往那伽腊迦师坻耶的路。</span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>·假说辑录</strong></span></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"dae92171ce24d2a0a212f9a00d43cb15\" title=\"11月奖励.png\" alt=\"11月奖励.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/pic/20240822/dae92171ce24d2a0a212f9a00d43cb15.png\"/></div><p></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">假说辑录添加内容</span></span></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">假说辑录的等级上限提升至</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">110</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">。</span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><strong>11月稀有奖励魂灵印象家具收藏包二</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">讲述者们一旦从故事中脱身，就再难清楚记起其中的器物纹饰。<span style=\"background-color:#1f1f1f\">被他们逐渐遗忘的每一座卡兹戴尔都期待着，期待着“于梦中再诞”，或是沉溺在“时序的洄流”。</span></span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><strong>11月稀有奖励模组数据整合箱</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">数据内容的整合，系统工程的结晶。能够增强干员能力，或是辅助调整他们的作战方式。你会现在就思考如何使用它吗？抑或是收入囊中，等待更合适的时机？</span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>·本月委托栏</strong></span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">本月委托栏将会覆盖一批委托。委托更新后，上月的委托进度将不会被继承。</span></span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">您将获得可在本月使用的四次刷新未完成委托的机会。点击刷新后，即可重新获得同等级的委托。</span></span></span></p>",
